      {
        "id": 153515,
        "name": "The Burning Stickman",
        "username": "The_Burning_Stickman",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/the_burning_stickman/{size}/2003_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-18T20:06:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"carnilius\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d07c76/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> carnilius:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Start a game with two Electro Pulse Explosives in play (1 played for the the play phase, 1 played for Rampaging Robot) and there's not much you can do to not lose by the start of his second turn.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>They do damaged based on HP, so unless you manage a bad draw where <em>nobody</em> has any damage, it's perfectly possible to minimize or even negate the damage there, especially if you have a five-hero team.</p>",
